{
  "title": "Unique Crunchy Peruvian Potatoes Papa Rellena",
  "description": "A resinous and creamy Peruvian dish featuring peanut brittle and deep-fried potatoes, this recipe is a low-calorie-friendly version of the traditional papa rellena.",
  "cuisine": "Peruvian",
